105
00:07:40,900 --> 00:07:43,253
Itadori, return to Meiji Shrine Station.

106
00:07:43,420 --> 00:07:45,497
Then head to Shibuya from the surface.

107
00:07:45,580 --> 00:07:48,698
Tell all the sorcerers there
about Gojo being sealed.

108
00:07:48,960 --> 00:07:51,960
Convince them they must
collaborate to rescue Gojo.

109
00:07:52,160 --> 00:07:52,990
Right.

110
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:56,240
