for Itadori to escape.

111
00:07:56,400 --> 00:08:00,057
After defeating the curse users, I'd like
you to manage things out here for a while.

112
00:08:00,140 --> 00:08:02,357
I don't know what moves
the enemy will make.

113
00:08:02,440 --> 00:08:03,852
We'll adapt and respond.

114
00:08:04,380 --> 00:08:07,877
By the way, they haven't frozen
your bank account yet, have they?

115
00:08:07,960 --> 00:08:08,790
Ah.

116
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:11,620
If Satoru Gojo disappears,

117
00:08:12,000 --> 00:08:14,817
the Jujutsu world and the human
world will both be upended.

118
00:08:14,900 --> 00:08:17,547
I need you to please
stake your life on this.

119
00:08:18,240 --> 00:08:21,097
I used to think it would be okay
if everything was destroyed.

120
00:08:21,180 --> 00:08:22,121
I was the worst.

121
00:08:22,300 --> 00:08:23,241
I know that now.

122
00:08:23,640 --> 00:08:25,077
Hey, anything for me to do?

123
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,042
Follow whoever.

124
00:08:26,300 --> 00:08:27,200
Fix this news!

125
00:08:28,640 --> 00:08:30,480
Hey, everyone. Incoming.

126
00:08:35,140 --> 00:08:36,434
You're Mei-Mei, right?

127
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:39,640
Go ahead and do your best.

128
00:08:39,960 --> 00:08:41,136
I'll match you both.

129
00:08:41,720 --> 00:08:42,550
Let's go!

130
00:08:45,520 --> 00:08:47,200
Looks like you're all awake.

131
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:50,600
