Looks like physical time
doesn't pass inside here.

135
00:09:16,940 --> 00:09:18,780
Man, did I screw up or what?

136
00:09:19,180 --> 00:09:21,004
This place is all kinds of bad.

137
00:09:22,580 --> 00:09:24,521
Well, it'll all work out somehow.

138
00:09:27,280 --> 00:09:30,460
I have faith in everyone.

139
00:09:40,920 --> 00:09:42,155
It's true, all right.

140
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:45,477
Even accounting for those
trapped inside the station,

141
00:09:45,560 --> 00:09:47,972
