by and start attacking.

146
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:05,237
There wasn't much else we could do.

147
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:08,144
Our response is starting
to fall too far behind.

148
00:10:08,260 --> 00:10:10,280
But I have an even bigger concern.

149
00:10:10,940 --> 00:10:14,357
The veil keeping sorcerers out
that was lowered at the same time.

150
00:10:14,440 --> 00:10:18,087
It has been a while now since
Satoru Gojo arrived at the site.

151
00:10:18,180 --> 00:10:20,239
Why'd they choose now of all times?

152
00:10:20,500 --> 00:10:21,897
Either something has happened,

153
00:10:21,980 --> 00:10:26,277
or they needed to wait long enough for
this moment as part of their strategy.

154
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:30,831
All I can say for certain, these aren't
the types to face us without a plan.

155
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:35,097
I'll focus on the enemies
who lowered the veils.

156
00:10:35,180 --> 00:10:38,062
You two, please rescue
all the civilians you can.

157
00:10:52,420 --> 00:10:53,760
Yes, right.

158
00:10:54,260 --> 00:10:58,378
Once you've confirmed the situation,
please exit the Vale again, Nita.

159
00:10:58,780 --> 00:11:00,557
With the signal blocked inside,

160
00:11:00,640 --> 00:11:04,228
