that is Satoru Gojo.

180
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:16,633
We won't be able to move it for a while.

181
00:12:27,060 --> 00:12:28,300
Score one for them.

182
00:12:29,780 --> 00:12:31,820
Itadori, good news. Huh?

183
00:12:32,300 --> 00:12:36,477
They can't move Gojo from where he
was sealed on floor B5. Why not?

184
00:12:36,560 --> 00:12:38,340
Because he's Satoru Gojo.

185
00:12:38,940 --> 00:12:39,820
Makes sense.

186
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,616
Let's encircle them.

187
00:12:41,820 --> 00:12:44,017
We'll have sorcerers
follow the subway lines

188
00:12:44,100 --> 00:12:46,417
into Shibuya from each
neighboring station.

189
00:12:46,500 --> 00:12:50,029
Once the veil keeping sorcerers
out is lifted, we charge in.

190
00:12:50,140 --> 00:12:51,557
Have sorcerers follow them?

191
