But I can't get a hold of Ijichi.

192
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,360
Oh, what?

193
00:12:56,240 --> 00:12:59,181
Hey, do you have any idea
who was sent to Shibuya?

194
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,500
Well, let me see.

195
00:13:13,000 --> 00:13:15,120
Help me, please!

196
00:13:40,080 --> 00:13:42,660
Today you call for me.

197
00:14:12,860 --> 00:14:14,100
NANAMI!

198
00:14:20,280 --> 00:14:21,520
NANAMI!

199
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:23,560
NANAMI!

200
00:14:23,680 --> 00:14:25,020
Are you here?

201
00:14:26,180 --> 00:14:27,420
NANAMI!

202
00:14:27,560 --> 00:14:28,500
Are you here?

203
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:30,780
Huh? NANAMI?

204
00:14:31,560 --> 00:14:33,860
Gojo is in trouble!

205
00:14:35,840 --> 00:14:37,737
He's been sealed.

206
00:14:37,820 --> 00:14:42,457
He's been sealed. He's been sealed.

207
00:14:42,540 --> 00:14:44,437
You two, change of plans?

208
00:14:44,520 --> 00:14:47,217
We need to meet up with Itadori at once.

209
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:49,397
If it's true that Gojo's been sealed,

210
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:52,737
then it's over for every
human in this country.

211
00:14:52,820 --> 00:14:56,877
Oh man, now they know what we're doing.

212
00:14:56,960 --> 00:15:00,237
The sorcerers are going to
be coming here in full force.

213
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:01,337
I've decided.

214
00:15:01,420 --> 00:15:02,397
I'll be staying behind.

215
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:03,917
What about all of you?

216
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:08,757
I'll avenge my younger brothers by
killing Yuji Itadori and Nobara Kugisaki.

217
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:11,437
Then I'll make my way to
Jujutsu High and release

218
00:15:11,520 --> 00:15:13,397
the rest of my brothers
from their captivity.

219
00:15:13,480 --> 00:15:16,537
I don't care about
Kugisaki. But we're turning.

220
00:15:16,620 --> 00:15:18,300
Itadori into Sukuna.

221
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:19,680
Not my problem.

222
00:15:24,120 --> 00:15:25,340
Jogo, calm down.

223
00:15:29,620 --> 00:15:32,267
Honestly, I think I want
to kill Itadori too.

224
00:15:32,720 --> 00:15:34,520
