We are not like the humans of today.

242
00:16:39,180 --> 00:16:43,820
We do not fear death, and we follow the
path to our goals without falsehoods.

243
00:16:43,940 --> 00:16:47,764
And that is the essence of us
older curses that those fakes lack.

244
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:48,750
You're wrong.

245
00:16:49,520 --> 00:16:52,557
No matter how off-kilter or
inconsistent we've become,

246
00:16:52,640 --> 00:16:55,997
we always act in strict accordance
with our truest desires.

247
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:58,139
That's what it means to be a curse.

248
00:16:58,340 --> 00:17:01,897
Oh, when I said you were wrong, I
meant regarding what curses are.

249
00:17:01,980 --> 00:17:04,537
I agree that the whole resurrection
thing is a good strategy,

250
00:17:04,620 --> 00:17:07,117
and I really don't want
to fight you over it.

251
00:17:07,200 --> 00:17:09,340
So how about we play a game?

252
00:17:09,840 --> 00:17:13,540
If I find Itadori first, then
I get to kill him like I want.

253
00:17:14,240 --> 00:17:18,777
If you find him first, you can give him the
fingers and let Sukuna regain his power.

254
00:17:18,860 --> 00:17:21,057
And if I find him first,
I get to kill him.

255
00:17:21,140 --> 00:17:22,200
Okay. Hey!

256
00:17:22,580 --> 00:17:24,220
Oh, you want in too, Choso?

257
00:17:24,520 --> 00:17:25,873
Of course, that's fine.

258
00:17:26,160 --> 00:17:29,297
You're more on Jogo's side if
you had to pick, right, Code?

259
00:17:29,380 --> 00:17:30,500
Or am I wrong?

260
00:17:30,900 --> 00:17:33,817
I have to remain here to
watch over the prison realm.

261
00:17:33,900 --> 00:17:35,740
So I'll abstain from the game.

262
00:17:37,280 --> 00:17:39,045
I'm fine with whatever you do.

263
00:17:39,340 --> 00:17:40,752
As far as I'm concerned,

264
00:17:40,920 --> 00:17:44,517
Sukuna was always just the backup
plan in case the prison realm failed.

265
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:45,718
This is ridiculous.

266
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:47,937
All the sorcerers, including Itadori,

267
00:17:48,020 --> 00:17:50,697
will be headed this way to
save Gojo, and we're arguing.

268
00:17:50,780 --> 00:17:52,839
So all you have to do is wait here.

269
00:17:53,140 --> 00:17:54,787
This won't be really a game.

270
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:06,160
Those cursed spirits are actually smarter
than the two of you give him back.

271
00:18:10,800 --> 00:18:14,937
We cooperated with you fully and
kept dropping monkeys for you.

272
00:18:15,020 --> 00:18:18,377
Now give us back Master
Gato's body like you promised.

273
00:18:18,460 --> 00:18:22,637
Don't toy with Master Code
any further than you have.

274
00:18:22,720 --> 00:18:25,237
Obviously, I'm keeping him.

275
00:18:25,320 --> 00:18:29,097
I don't recall leaving either of
your heads empty, but maybe I forgot.

276
00:18:29,180 --> 00:18:31,997
The next time you make a
promise with a sorcerer,

277
00:18:32,080 --> 00:18:34,537
you should make sure it's a
pact that can never be broken.

278
00:18:34,620 --> 00:18:38,860
Now be gone or is it your desire
to be killed by this body?

279
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:43,340
You'll regret this.

280
00:18:45,520 --> 00:18:46,350
Regret? Huh.

281
00:18:46,433 --> 00:18:50,900
Now what did regret taste like again?

282
00:18:56,280 --> 00:18:58,080
NANAMI! NANAMI!

283
00:18:59,000 --> 00:18:59,830
NANAMI!

284
00:19:01,760 --> 00:19:03,560
NANAMI! Hey there.

285
00:19:05,220 --> 00:19:06,160
Say hey, moron.

286
00:19:07,420 --> 00:19:08,250
NANAMI!

287
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:11,460
Fushiguro! Kento dude! And who?

288
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:14,140
You really refer to NANAMI like that?

289
00:19:16,040 --> 00:19:16,960
Code did?

290
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:22,200
To be more precise, the thing
that's living within Suguru Code.

291
00:19:23,120 --> 00:19:25,617
Shibuya Station is in
Pandemonium right now.

292
00:19:25,700 --> 00:19:27,437
It's full of those special grades,

293
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:30,937
the cursed spirits they brought with
them, the curse users tied to Code,

294
00:19:31,020 --> 00:19:33,657
as well as transfigured
humans and normal people.

295
00:19:33,740 --> 00:19:34,570
In that case,

296
00:19:34,653 --> 00:19:37,957
it'd be faster to attack through the
subway from the neighboring stations.

297
00:19:38,040 --> 00:19:41,687
But to do that, we need to find
a way to lift that veil first.

298
00:19:42,220 --> 00:19:43,297
It's an emergency.

299
00:19:43,380 --> 00:19:44,800
Please multitask.

300
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:47,951
Guess this isn't the time for complaining.

301
00:19:48,040 --> 00:19:51,237
There are several things only a
first-grade sorcerer can manage.

302
00:19:51,320 --> 00:19:55,144
I'm just going to step outside
and take care of this with Ijichi.

303
00:19:55,580 --> 00:19:56,517
During that time,

304
00:19:56,600 --> 00:20:00,437
I want you three to do something
about the veil keeping sorcerers out.

305
00:20:00,520 --> 00:20:01,350
Ino.

306
00:20:02,580 --> 00:20:07,462
Kusakabe and special first-grade sorcerer
Zenin should be inside this veil as well.

307
00:20:07,640 --> 00:20:09,237
If you're able to meet up with them,

308
00:20:09,320 --> 00:20:12,517
please relay this situation and
request their immediate help.

309
00:20:12,600 --> 00:20:15,337
Thanks to Itadori's shouting,
I'm sure they already know.

310
00:20:15,420 --> 00:20:16,250
Roger that.

311
00:20:18,620 --> 00:20:20,326
Also, take care of these two.

312
00:20:22,160 --> 00:20:22,990
Fright!

313
00:20:26,140 --> 00:20:26,970
Ina?

314
00:20:27,920 --> 00:20:30,160
Nanami is counting on me.

315
00:20:30,980 --> 00:20:31,810
You two!

316
00:20:32,280 --> 00:20:35,877
Before we start the mission, let me
make it clear how important this is.

317
00:20:35,960 --> 00:20:36,790
Listen up!

318
00:20:36,880 --> 00:20:39,480
Losing Gojo creates two major issues.

319
00:20:40,080 --> 00:20:42,280
First, the collapse of the Gojo clan.

320
00:20:42,620 --> 00:20:46,337
The Gojo clan is currently a
one-man team of Satoru Gojo himself.

321
00:20:46,420 --> 00:20:49,577
There are lots of sorcerers who have
been saved due to Gojo's influence,

322
00:20:49,660 --> 00:20:50,660
pride, and wimps.

323
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:53,537
Itadori, you're one of
those sorcerers, right?

324
00:20:53,620 --> 00:20:55,080
Oh, yeah! Casual, huh?

325
00:20:55,660 --> 00:20:59,317
All of those people he saved are going
to find themselves in some major trouble.

326
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:01,197
And in the worst case...

327
00:21:01,280 --> 00:21:04,868
That brings us to Issue 2, the
collapse of the power battles.

328
00:21:05,240 --> 00:21:07,577
All of the cursed spirits and
curse users who've been keeping

329
00:21:07,660 --> 00:21:11,377
quiet because Gojo was around will
start taking action all at once.

330
00:21:11,460 --> 00:21:14,197
Now, if the guys from
Issue 2 try starting a war,

331
00:21:14,280 --> 00:21:17,397
while society is in disarray
from fighting over Issue 1?

332
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,480
we're gonna lose.

333
00:21:18,940 --> 00:21:21,077
That's the futurist Nanami and I see it.

334
00:21:21,160 --> 00:21:22,997
So what do you think happens if we lose?

335
00:21:23,080 --> 00:21:27,717
I would imagine at the very least that
the age of humans would be over for Japan.

336
00:21:27,800 --> 00:21:29,388
I see I've taught you well.

337
00:21:31,820 --> 00:21:33,380
Now, let's go you guys!

338
00:21:33,800 --> 00:21:37,388
The three of us will break that
bill before Nanami gets back!

339
00:21:37,860 --> 00:21:39,800
Let's rescue Satoru Gojo!

340
00:21:55,020 --> 00:21:57,820
Thank you.

341
00:22:24,300 --> 00:22:27,100
Thank you.

342
00:23:10,920 --> 00:23:13,080
Did you hear that, Awasaka?

343
00:23:13,800 --> 00:23:16,080
Satoru Gojo has been sealed.

344
00:23:16,740 --> 00:23:19,387
They're leaking information
to their enemies.

345
00:23:19,480 --> 00:23:21,580
What's wrong with that, old Ogami?

346
00:23:21,880 --> 00:23:24,720
It's finally starting to feel real to me.

347
00:23:25,480 --> 00:23:28,220
Satoru Gojo really has been sealed.

348
00:23:29,100 --> 00:23:30,720
I'm getting excited.

349
00:23:31,280 --> 00:23:34,540
I wonder what's going to
happen to this country now.

350
00:23:35,400 --> 00:23:36,880
Nothing new will happen.

351
00:23:37,240 --> 00:23:39,828
People will still curse,
be cursed, and die.

352
00:23:39,960 --> 00:23:40,900
Did you hear?

353
00:23:41,080 --> 00:23:43,277
They said Gojo's little Satoru was sealed.

354
00:23:43,360 --> 00:23:46,937
Oh, my, I always thought that
would happen to that boy one day.

355
00:23:47,020 --> 00:23:48,817
He was always flaunting his style,

356
00:23:48,900 --> 00:23:51,217
acting like he was nothing
but leg below his nipples.

357
00:23:51,300 --> 00:23:52,357
Next time, seance.

358
00:23:52,440 --> 00:23:53,558
Code, did you hear?

359
00:23:53,760 --> 00:23:54,936
The Gojo's little...
